1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Good morning! Did you sleep well?

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,400
Not really. The neighbors rehearsed
their band until midnight.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Let's get a coffee before the meeting.

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,400
The quarterly forecast looks
surprisingly optimistic.

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,800
I'll believe it when I see the numbers.

6
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,500
Fair enough. See you at the elevator.
